hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"15534","Abd al-Samad narrated to us: My father narrated to us: Ata ibn al-Saib narrated to us, he said: Hakim ibn Abi Yazid narrated to me, from his father, he said: My father narrated to me that the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) said: Leave the people, let some of them benefit from others, and if one of you seeks sincere advice from his brother, let him give him sincere advice."
